Third-party code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

`lib/index.js` is a DERIVED BUILD. It is the compiled
`@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client` bundle, extracted unmodified from an installed
DeepSeek Harness application and then patched at exactly two sites.

  Upstream package : @deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client
  Upstream version : 0.2.0-rc.2
  Upstream license : MIT
  Upstream source  : https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
                     (packages/mcp/mcp-client)
  Upstream LICENSE : reproduced verbatim in LICENSE

The upstream copyright notice and permission notice are retained as required by
the MIT License.

Changes made to the derived build:

  1. `clientInfo` passed to the MCP `Client` constructor gains a `title`
     ("DeepSeek Harness") and the real harness version in place of the
     hardcoded placeholder `"0.0.1"`.

  2. `tools/call` request params gain an optional
     `_meta: { session_id: <agent session id> }`, taken from
     `execution.agent.id` when an Agent is present on the tool execution.

Nothing else is altered. `sync.mjs` reconstitutes this file from the installed
application and asserts on both patch sites; if the upstream shape changes it
fails rather than emitting an unpatched artifact.

